	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="de"><foreign xml:lang="la">Non dubito, vir clarissime, quin nomina eorum, qui <placeName ref="l18">Augustae Vindelicorum</placeName> convenerunt, ad componendum videlicet negotium religionis, scias, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>nempe comissarii</foreign> in nammen caiserlicher majestat, churfürst von <placeName ref="l307">Mentz</placeName> und doctor <persName>Niclaus Hass</persName>, <placeName>Mentz</placeName> wychbischoff, Köln <persName>Philippus Münch</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>Trier <persName>Johann von Leyen</persName>, thumbherr, Pfaltz doctor <persName>Wolff von Affenstein</persName>, ritter, Saxen doctor Fuchs, <placeName ref="l1048">Brandenburg</placeName> <persName>Eustachius von Schleychen</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>der geistlichen fürsten <persName>Heinrich Thürmüg</persName>, der wältlichen fürsten doctor <persName>Egg von Randegg</persName>, der pręlaten apt von <placeName ref="l1294">Wingarten</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>der graffen einer von <placeName>Montfort</placeName>, der fry und rychstetten <persName ref="p6733">Jacob Sturm</persName> von <placeName ref="l491">Straßburg</placeName>, <persName>Georgius Besserer</persName> von <placeName ref="l513">Ulm</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Mirum, qualem <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>religionem hi nobis sint inventuri tradituri, videlicet pacificam, tranquillam, verbo dei convenientissimam; sed ecce plane diversum: diabolicam, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>papisticam; nam, humanissime vir, in cartis his litteris appositis habebis, quam egregie isti coram mundo sapientissimi viri exeruerint ingenii <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>sui vires nihil aliud tradentes, quam quod partim abolitum erat et in quibusdam locis, partim vero non.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Ad haec omnes hi ab uno reguntur viro et nebulone, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>quod liquet ex his 20 capitibus, non quidem papa aut <persName>Caesare</persName>, sed episcopo <placeName ref="l2427">Sidoniensi</placeName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><persName ref="p5190">Michael Helding</persName>, Titularbischof von <placeName ref="l2427">Sidon</placeName>(?).</note>, suffraganio <placeName ref="l307">Moguntiae</placeName>, qui 15 concionibus suis ita omnibus persuasit <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>(quas ego legi), ut nihil aliud, quam quod continetur in sermonibus suis, eodem ferme ordine et modo eademque prope verba nobsi tradant.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Cogitabam <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>autem te nondum habiturum hoc decretum conventus <placeName ref="l18">Augustani</placeName>, quia his diebus <placeName ref="l28">Basiliensis</placeName> quidam modo ex <placeName ref="l18">Augusta</placeName> rediens et ocyssime iter per <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>nostram civitatem faciens haec secum tulit mihique forte oblata celerrime interum, dum prandium sumeret, descripsi.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Symmistis meis obtuli adhortans, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>ut et ad te mitterent tibi tum etiam semel tantum scriberent; sed idem me iusserunt.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Quare, vir integerrime, tuae haec mitto humanitati [obsecrans], <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>ut male compositam scripturam et incompositam etiam hanc schędam boni consulas tuaeque humanitati nos omnes semper comendatos h[abeas].</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Si quid novi est, ad nos scribere digneris; nam ego deinde etiam seniores adeo negligentes sumus, ut nullis te litteris provocet, quo et tuae <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>humanitatis epistolae ad nos perferantur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Sed vale, vir praestantissime, nostroque nomine <persName ref="p8171">Theodorum</persName>, <persName ref="p8127">Pellicanum</persName>, <persName ref="p8011">Gvaltherum</persName> caeterosque omnes salutabis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Datae postridie calendas iunii anno 1548.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l441">Scaphusiae</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/><persName ref="p2757">Iacobus Rüger</persName>, tuae humanitati <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>deditissimus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Eruditione et virtute praestanti viro D. M. <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><persName ref="p495">Heynricho Bullingero</persName>, ecclesiae <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>pastori vigilantissimo, domino suo observandissimo.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z4"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurum</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
